(RESIDENTIAL TENANCY LEASE AGREEMENT \(KIRAYANAMA\)) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(This Tenancy Agreement is executed at Lahore on this 1st day of February, 2025, by) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(and between:) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(MR. MUHAMMAD FAROOQ, CNIC No. 35202-1234567-1, resident of House No. 12, Street 4,) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Sector Y, DHA Phase 3, Lahore \(hereinafter called the "LANDLORD", which term includes) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(his legal heirs, executors, and assigns\) of the FIRST PART;) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(AND) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(MR. BILAL AHMED KHAN, CNIC No. 35201-9876543-3, resident of Flat 4, Model Town,) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Lahore \(hereinafter called the "TENANT", which term includes his legal heirs,) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(executors, and permitted occupants\) of the SECOND PART.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(WHEREAS Landlord is the absolute and lawful owner of residential property situated at) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(House No. 85, Sector Z, DHA Phase 5, Lahore, comprising 1 Kanal house with 4) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(bedrooms, drawing room, kitchen, and lawn \("Rented Premises"\); and) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(WHEREAS Tenant has agreed to take the Rented Premises on rent on the following terms) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(and conditions:) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(1. TENANCY PERIOD AND RENEWAL) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(1.1 Duration. The tenancy shall be for an initial period of eleven \(11\) months,) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(commencing from February 1, 2025 and expiring on December 31, 2025.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(1.2 Renewal. The tenancy may be renewed by mutual consent of both parties through a) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(fresh written agreement signed at least one \(1\) month prior to expiry.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(1.3 Escalation. If renewed, the monthly rent shall increase by 10% \(ten percent\)) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(annually.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(2. MONTHLY RENT AND SECURITY DEPOSIT) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(2.1 Monthly Rent. The agreed monthly rent is PKR 150,000/- \(Rupees One Hundred Fifty) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Thousand only\).) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(2.2 Payment Due Date. Tenant shall pay the monthly rent in advance on or before the) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(5th calendar day of each month via direct bank transfer to Landlord's designated bank) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(account.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(2.3 Security Deposit. Tenant has deposited PKR 300,000/- \(Rupees Three Hundred) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Thousand only, equivalent to two months rent\) as refundable security deposit with) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Landlord. This deposit shall be refunded upon peaceful handover of possession after) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(deducting unpaid utility bills or repair costs for tenant-caused damages.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(3. UTILITIES AND TAXES) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(3.1 Utility Bills. Tenant shall promptly pay all utility charges for electricity) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(\(LESCO\), gas \(SNGPL\), water, sanitation, and DHA maintenance charges according to) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(actual consumption bills.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(3.2 Property Tax. Government property taxes and capital value levies shall be the) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(sole responsibility of Landlord.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(4. TENANT'S COVENANTS AND RESTRICTIONS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(4.1 Residential Use Only. The premises shall be used exclusively for peaceful) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(residential family living. Commercial activities, guest house operations, or illegal) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(uses are strictly prohibited.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(4.2 No Subletting. Tenant shall not sublet, assign, or share possession of the) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(premises or any part thereof with any third party.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(4.3 Structural Alterations. Tenant shall make no structural changes, alterations, or) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(demolitions without Landlord's prior written permission.) '
ET
