(4.4 Cleanliness and Maintenance. Tenant shall maintain the property in clean and good) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(sanitary condition, responsible for minor day-to-day repairs \(plumbing washers,) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(bulbs, switchboards\).) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(5. INSPECTION AND REPAIRS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(5.1 Landlord Inspection. Landlord or his authorized agent shall have the right to) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(inspect the premises during reasonable daytime hours upon giving twenty-four \(24\)) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(hours advance notice.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(5.2 Major Repairs. Structural defects, roof leakage, or major seepage shall be) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(rectified by Landlord at his own expense within reasonable time.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(6. TERMINATION AND VACATION) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(6.1 Notice Period. Either party may terminate this tenancy before expiry by serving) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(one \(1\) month advance written notice or paying one month rent in lieu of notice.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(6.2 Default Eviction. If Tenant fails to pay rent for two consecutive months or) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(breaches any fundamental clause, Landlord may issue a 15-day notice to vacate) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(pursuant to the Punjab Rented Premises Act, 2009.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(6.3 Handover. Upon vacation, Tenant shall deliver peaceful vacant possession in the) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(same condition as received, normal wear and tear excepted.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(7. REGISTRATION AND DISPUTE RESOLUTION) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(This agreement shall be registered with the local Police Station and Rent Tribunal) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(pursuant to the Punjab Rented Premises Act. Disputes shall be subject to the) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(exclusive jurisdiction of the Rent Tribunal, Lahore.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(IN WITNESS WHEREOF, Landlord and Tenant have set their hands in the presence of) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(witnesses.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
